{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in 1985, you take on the role of a member of the M.E.G. (Major Explorer Group) a faction formed within the Backrooms to explore uncharted levels and make them safer for wanderers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During an expedition, you unknowingly stumble into one of the most dangerous levels known: <strong>Level !</strong>. There\u2019s no time to think. You have but one objective from there:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for your life.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: The Descent</strong> is an indie horror exploration/survival game that follows the lore of the Backrooms Wiki/Fandom, featuring eerie liminal spaces,\u00a0<strong>resources you must manage</strong> to stay alive and various <strong>togglable entities</strong> within select levels, that you must avoid while navigating your way through for any sign of human life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 initial lore accurate levels with variation and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints/ saves at the beginning of every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management (food and water etc.)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789810?t=1763423832","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789810?t=1763423832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789810/20766f7da47157c255a7b4b74c429df2b80d50de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763423832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789810/20766f7da47157c255a7b4b74c429df2b80d50de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763423832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game includes jump-scares and frightening scenes that may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in 1985, you take on the role of a member of the M.E.G. (Major Explorer Group) a faction formed within the Backrooms to explore uncharted levels and make them safer for wanderers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During an expedition, you unknowingly stumble into one of the most dangerous levels known: <strong>Level !</strong>. There\u2019s no time to think. You have but one objective from there:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for your life.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: The Descent</strong> is an indie horror exploration/survival game that follows the lore of the Backrooms Wiki/Fandom, featuring eerie liminal spaces,\u00a0<strong>resources you must manage</strong> to stay alive and various <strong>togglable entities</strong> within select levels, that you must avoid while navigating your way through for any sign of human life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 initial lore accurate levels with variation and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints/ saves at the beginning of every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management (food and water etc.)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Demon_Rec."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789810/37d72937d259718ffa68fdbea3cb9e37c19d30d7/header.jpg?t=176